 ## Changed This Session
 
-- Code or behavior added:
-- Infrastructure or harness changes:
+- Baseline fixes (separate commits, before feature work):
+  - renderer type errors (wrong `shared/types` path, unused React imports)
+  - `indexing.status()` shape did not match what the UI read (`AppStatus` now has `indexStatus`, `documentsLoaded`, `indexedCount`, `lastActivity`)
+  - indexing a single document never updated `index-meta.json` or the document status, so Q&A could not cite it
+  - "+ Import" was a stub; `File.path` is gone in Electron 33 -> `documents.pathForFile` (webUtils) in preload
+  - **preload never loaded**: sandboxed preloads cannot `require('../shared/types')`. The preload is now bundled with esbuild (`npm run build:preload`, also in `scripts/dev.js`)
+  - `vitest.config.ts` added (vite.config's `root: src/renderer` hid tests)
+- Features: answer ids + `feedback.submit/list` (feedback.json); `app.reset()` (`app:reset` -> `PersistenceService.resetAll`) with an in-page confirm; question panel = full conversation (`ConversationHistory`, `ConfidenceIndicator`, `FeedbackButtons`, `ResetControl`). The old "Show History" toggle and single last-answer card are gone.
+- Harness: `scripts/verify-app.sh [feature...]` + `scripts/verify-app/{driver.js,steps.js}` drive the built app inside Electron on a temp data dir (renderer only uses `window.knowledgeBase` + DOM). Driver extras: `reload` step, `screenshot=<file.png>` step, `EXTRA_STEPS=<file.js>` for ad-hoc debug steps.
 
